      ":question/problem": "There is a correlation between \"the temperature outside is hot\" and \"people buy more ice cream.\" Which of the following is most likely true?\n\n1. An increase in temperature causes people to buy more ice cream.\n2. An increase in ice cream sales causes an increase in temperature.\n3. More people outside causes the temperature to rise and people to buy more ice cream."
